## Architecture Decision Made Today

**Frontend should NEVER connect to PostgreSQL directly.**

```
Frontend (Next.js :8000) → Medusa Backend (:9001) → PostgreSQL (:5432)
```

- Public reads (showcase) → Next.js API route **proxies** to Medusa backend
- Authenticated writes (generate, like) → Next.js calls Medusa backend with credentials
- DB credentials only exist on Medusa backend

