## Key Decisions Made

| # | Decision | Rationale |
|---|----------|-----------|
| 1 | YARL for lightbox with `dynamic(ssr: false)` | Avoids webpack SSR bundling issues with Next.js 14.0.4 |
| 2 | Single-column layout for studio | Cleaner, mobile-first, less overwhelming |
| 3 | Only visual factors in generation form | Weight/eggless don't change the image — moved to Price Estimator |
| 4 | Shape added to generation form | Heart vs Round is visually different |
| 5 | Price model: baseByWeight × tierMultiplier | More realistic than flat base + additive |
| 6 | All cakes eggless by default | No extra charge, removed toggle |
| 7 | Showcase = community gallery with real DB data | Social proof + inspiration + "Use this prompt" |
| 8 | Frontend never connects to DB directly | Industry standard — always through backend |
| 9 | Proxy pattern for frontend → backend | Hides backend URL, consistent with existing architecture |
| 10 | Public by default for generated designs | Showcase fills naturally, opt-out later |

